  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for CBR Research and Development of SRHR Products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote healthy and more resilient populations in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs), CBR will: (1) accelerate SRHR through development of next-generation contraceptives; (2) develop products to enhance maternal and newborn health; and (3) develop and introduce user-centered technologies for HIV. Collectively, CBR&#x2019;s portfolio will fill existing market gaps; increase access and choice; and empower women and girls to achieve bodily autonomy.</narrative>
  </description>
